<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer-G7 to look at impact of move to euro.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer-G7 to look at impact of move to euro.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Group of Seven will discuss the impact on Europe's transition to a single currency at its meeting in Berlin today, Bundesbank president Hans Tietmeyer said.</p>
<p>&quot;We will look at the effects of the move to the euro,&quot; Tietmeyer said.</p>
<p>&quot;We assume it will be an internationally stable currency and that it will be a reserve currency alongside the dollar.&quot;</p>
<p>--Berlin Newsroom +49 30 203 9810</p>
</text>
